        <mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#8A77B3;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.83;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pol" target="rules">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="1935" y="416"/>
              <mxPoint x="984.05" y="416"/>
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="commit" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;LOCAL DURABILITY BOUNDARY&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Admission reserves the action and aggregate usage with approval consumption and audit, before the adapter runs.&lt;br&gt;Signal transactions persist their resulting holds and audit. These are separate lifecycle transactions.&lt;br&gt;Required recording failures block new admission; a downstream effect is outside the local transaction.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#EDF7EF;strokeColor=#63A173;fontColor=#254D30;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="50" y="690" width="1575" height="133"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="metrics" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;Metrics + audit export&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Asynchronous downstream observability&lt;br&gt;Export retries never retry actions&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#A9B5C3;fontColor=#283B50;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1680" y="690" width="510" height="133"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#4D9361;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.832;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="holds" target="commit">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="1375" y="662"/>
              <mxPoint x="1360" y="662"/>
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#7C8C9A;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="commit" target="metrics">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="restore-h" value="&lt;b&gt;B  AUTHORIZED RESTORATION AND HOST RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#42576B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="853" width="2160" height="29"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="owner" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;Authorized Owner&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Investigates the cause and reviews&lt;br&gt;restoration evidence&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#EAF2FF;strokeColor=#527BA7;fontColor=#123555;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="50" y="918" width="350" height="215"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="requestrestore" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;Restoration request&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Restriction ID + expected revision&lt;br&gt;Principal / auth reference&lt;br&gt;Reason + reviewed evidence reference&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#F1EEFF;strokeColor=#8A77B3;fontColor=#3C2E64;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="450" y="908" width="430" height="215"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="restore" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;Restoration checks differ by API&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Both: authenticate owner, check active hold and&lt;br&gt;expected revision; require reason and evidence.&lt;br&gt;Feedback: also blocks matching DISPATCHED or&lt;br&gt;EXECUTION_UNKNOWN actions.&lt;br&gt;Campaign: host must supply that unresolved check.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#E7F7F6;strokeColor=#28918B;fontColor=#154A47;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="930" y="908" width="535" height="215"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="newcontext" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;Clear only the specified hold&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Other holds, consumed approvals and reservations remain.&lt;br&gt;Feedback epochs keep earlier proposals stale.&lt;br&gt;Campaign context compares active holds only; a hold cycle&lt;br&gt;can return to the earlier digest. The host must invalidate&lt;br&gt;pre-hold proposals and require fresh applicable review.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#FFF4DE;strokeColor=#CB9A3B;fontColor=#674813;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1525" y="908" width="665" height="215"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e10" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#58718B;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="owner" target="requestrestore">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e11" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#58718B;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="requestrestore" target="restore">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#C29738;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="restore" target="newcontext">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e13" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#C29738;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="newcontext" target="next">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="2212" y="984"/>
              <mxPoint x="2212" y="536.5"/>
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="slow-h" value="&lt;b&gt;C  REVIEW TEST APPROVE AND RELEASE&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=21;fontColor=#42576B;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1220.0" width="2130" height="29"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cases" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;Audit review cases&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Offline extraction is implemented.&lt;br&gt;Cases remain UNREVIEWED evidence,&lt;br&gt;not new runtime permissions.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#EDF7EF;strokeColor=#63A173;fontColor=#254D30;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="50" y="1300.0" width="440" height="153"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="review" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;Product + Engineering Owners&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Investigate repeated causes.&lt;br&gt;Propose an adapter, agent, policy&lt;br&gt;or verification correction.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#EAF2FF;strokeColor=#527BA7;fontColor=#123555;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="540" y="1300.0" width="535" height="153"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="test" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;Regression tests + approvals&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Non-executing replay / test environment.&lt;br&gt;Validate the correction and obtain&lt;br&gt;responsible owner approval.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#A9B5C3;fontColor=#283B50;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1125" y="1300.0" width="500" height="153"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="release" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;Versioned reviewed release&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:1.28;&quot;&gt;Review changed context, Profile, policy or adapter.&lt;br&gt;Pin model routes, instructions, skills, memory&lt;br&gt;and orchestration; invalidate earlier proposals.&lt;br&gt;No automatic policy rewriting or model training.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#F1EEFF;strokeColor=#8A77B3;fontColor=#3C2E64;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=18;strokeWidth=1.6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1680" y="1300.0" width="510" height="153"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e14" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#58718B;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cases" target="review">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e15" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#58718B;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;dashed=1;dashPattern=7 5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="review" target="test">
